invariant: INV-16
file: poly1305.c
catches: poly1305_equiv_test
reason: poly1305_update hands the vector path every whole block of a
  long update, not only its whole groups, so an update whose whole
  blocks are not a multiple of four hands it one to three blocks it does
  not take. poly1305_vector_blocks asserts its contract at the entry, and
  bin/poly1305_equiv_test runs every length from 0 to 416 bytes, so the
  first such length stops the binary.

--- old
        size_t grouped = n - n % POLY1305_VECTOR_GROUP;
--- new
        size_t grouped = n;
